Package: carbonite
Title: IBM's 'Carbon Design System' for 'shiny'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Evan", "Brand", , "etbrand@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("IBM Corp.", role = "cph", comment = "Carbon Design System assets")
  )
Description: 'shiny' bindings for IBM's 'Carbon Design System'
    <https://www.carbondesignsystem.com/>. Wraps the 'Carbon' web components
    ('@carbon/web-components') as 'shiny' inputs, outputs, and layouts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: See the file inst/COPYRIGHTS for the copyright holders and
    licenses of the bundled Carbon Design System code and fonts.
URL: https://github.com/etbrand/carbonite
BugReports: https://github.com/etbrand/carbonite/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    htmltools (>= 0.5.2),
    rlang,
    shiny (>= 1.5.0),
    utils
Encoding: UTF-8
SysDataCompression: xz
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
